### Dati utente (ora in ~/.javachess/) ###
# NB: archive.json and .idea/ are still tracked on purpose: removing them from git would delete the user's local copies
# on the next `git pull`. Untrack them (git rm --cached) once the archive has been migrated to ~/.javachess.
archive.json
!src/test/resources/**/archive*.json
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
.idea/
*.onnx.tmp
